    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d34">

                <pb facs="0111" n="21" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg21"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/953a</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Consul at Vladivostok</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Caldwell</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-01-08T19:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 8,
                                1918, 7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department desires immediate and specific information following points: <list>
                        <label>(1)</label>
                        <item>What authorities now control Vladivostok?</item>
                        <label>(2)</label>
                        <item>Do same authorities control Amur Province?</item>
                        <pb facs="0112" n="22" xml:id="pg22"/>
                        <label>(3)</label>
                        <item>How are authorities constituted?</item>
                        <label>(4)</label>
                        <item>What is their attitude towards Bolshevik authorities Petrograd?</item>
                        <label>(5)</label>
                        <item>Are they supported unanimously by soldiers and sailors?</item>
                        <label>(6)</label>
                        <item>Is port open; is it likely to remain so?</item>
                        <label>(7)</label>
                        <item>What is attitude of authorities, of soldiers, and of sailors toward
                            foreign population?</item>
                        <label>(8)</label>
                        <item>How many troops at Vladivostok and how many sailors? Ditto in
                            Province?</item>
                        <label>(9)</label>
                        <item>What prospect Stevens party
                            landing safely Vladivostok?</item>
                    </list></p>
                <p>No answer telegram December 28, 5 p.m.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d34-f1"/> Department
                    desires full information.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Lansing</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
